  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/df2a896fab1a2ae6ea128221efd962b06bf33b29.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1024\" height=\"73\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcopper-backport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg&;n=-1\" alt=\"\" width=\"164\" height=\"56\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/copper-backport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg&;n=-1\" alt=\"\" width=\"171\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>此模組將較新版本 Minecraft 中引入的銅盔甲與工具組帶入廣受歡迎的老版本遊戲中，以供模组使用。</em></p>\n<p><em>如果您想更进一步，加入最新版本中的染料，請查看我的<strong> <span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/dye-backport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">染料回溯資源包</a></span></strong>！</em></p>\n<p><em>來看看銅工具組、盔甲套裝，是的，<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">甚至是金塊</span>！</em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/90b5a3b87d621eb734c5c59a679a80f29d16a33d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1017\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong><em>本模組內的所有資產均歸 Mojang 所有，並非本人擁有。</em></strong></p>",
